 of dense white fibrous tissue with scattered yellow discolored areas and microcysts  This abnormal tissue averages 0 6cm from the deep margin  There is a 0 9cm in largest dimension firm tan white nodule  located in the medial aspect of the tissue  0 3cm from the inferior anterior margin  and 0 6cm from the deep margin  A representative section of this nodule is in A  Representative sections of fibrous and cystic areas are in B G  Representative sections of tissue beneath the scar are in H J  Representative sections of skin papules are in K  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of axillary tail attached to the specimen  with an axillary node designated by a long stitch  The axillary tail is dissected for lymph nodes  which are submitted in L P  Cassette N contains sections of a single node  Further representative sections of the breast tissue are in Q S  Designated  left breast lymph node  additional axillary tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of fatty tissue  containing several soft lymph nodes  The lymph nodes are fully submitted in T  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   report_end  , Absent.
